{
  "schema": 1,
  "comment": "The checks that own the repository paths, read by owner-check of @polyspec/kit: make owner-check runs the make targets (targets), the root npm scripts (scripts), the test scripts of workspaces (workspaces) and of package directories (prefixes) and the node test files (tests; $path is the changed test file) of the rules whose globs match a changed path. Every tracked path matches a rule; always lists the tests that run for every change. inputs declares, for a check named as make <target>, npm run <script>, npm test -w <workspace> or npm test --prefix <directory>, the globs of the paths that it reads; the owner check fails when a rule of such a path does not select that check. Globs: * within one path segment, ** across segments, {a,b} either alternative.",
